+/* LinuxKPI bottom halves are threaded on this port: PCI handlers are
+ * IOInterruptEventSource actions and tasklets run on taskqueue threads. They
+ * cannot asynchronously reenter the interrupted LinuxKPI stack. Native mutexes
+ * serialize shared state and the tasklet RUN state serializes each callback.
+ *
+ * FreeBSD's sched_pin only prohibits migration; mapping it to interrupt masking
+ * made a nested MTX_DEF acquisition sleep with interrupts off. These BH scopes
